This project builds on, and depends at runtime on, third-party work:

- Open Knowledge Format (OKF) / reference_agent
  GoogleCloudPlatform/knowledge-catalog — Apache License 2.0
  Used (unmodified, as a dependency) for: bundle visualization (viz.html),
  index.md generation, and OKF document (de)serialization/validation.
  https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/knowledge-catalog

- LLM Wiki pattern
  Originated by Andrej Karpathy (gist) and implemented by the llmwiki project.
  okf_wiki adapts the "drop documents → an LLM synthesizes a wiki" ergonomics
  and the synthesis-recipe idea (the GUIDE prompt) to the OKF format.
  https://gist.github.com/karpathy/442a6bf555914893e9891c11519de94f
  https://github.com/lucasastorian/llmwiki

The MIT license of okf_wiki covers only this project's own code
(the okf_wiki package, the okf-ingest skill, scripts and docs). Bundled or
depended-upon third-party components remain under their respective licenses.
